{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BEANDEJO</strong> is an <i>action-packed top-down roguelite shooter</i> stuffed with <i>spaghetti western</i> elements and veggie brutality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the Old West, where the cattle roam, the lawmen keep the peace, and drunken vegetables terrorize the local saloons! You are a Mexican jumping bean fixing to bring the long arm of the law to the disorderly vegetables of Cactusdale. Armed with your trusty revolver, will you lock up these nutritious varmints and become the town\u2019s next sheriff?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/spin_header.png?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/SpinGunWide.gif?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master a unique shooting style</strong>\u00a0- Timing and positioning are essential for success. Rotate your gun clockwise or counterclockwise to shoot your way to survival!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/die_header.png?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/death.gif?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unforgiving gameplay loop</strong> - How do you feel about dying over and over again? Each move must be quick and precise as you progress through different saloon rooms, as you are constantly outnumbered by a rogue\u2019s gallery of wicked bandits. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/heat_header.png?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/combo.gif?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heat System</strong> -\u00a0Hop through the saloons of Cactusdale, taking down vegetable outlaws as quick as you can to rack up a bigger bounty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/boss_header.png?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/boss.gif?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging boss fights</strong> - You might've died 20 times before you killed that scum, but isn't that the whole point of hardcore games?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/slots_header.png?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207200/extras/gamble.gif?t=1750477492\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The house always wins\u00a0</strong>- Spend your hard-earned money in slot machines to get helpful upgrades or weapons. Sometimes it's a question of survival, so don't be ashamed!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store